{"tool_name":"insert-poisson-noise","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This plugin can be used to add synthetic Poisson-distributed noise to an image in order to simulate shot noise of various signal-to-noise ratios. It can be used to generate benchmark images in order to assess the accuracy and robustness of image processing algorithms as a function of the noise level present in images.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This plugin can be used to add synthetic Poisson-distributed noise to an image in order to simulate shot noise of various signal-to-noise ratios. It can be used to generate benchmark images in order to assess the accuracy and robustness of image processing algorithms as a function of the noise level present in images.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-17T13:05:12+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-15T10:45:49+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4957,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"958eb9f2-e9a7-4ead-8e3a-2219c7a45eb8","url":"/taxonomy/term/4957"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505209304,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Janick Cardinale"},{"value":"Mosaic group"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"http://mosaic.mpi-cbg.de/Downloads/PoissonNoise_manual.pdf"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":98,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"2ae7ecac-ed23-4375-8a06-79f6a294e65b","url":"/user/98"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4180,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__R9FvNkpDIaqZQhLVlPsHisj","url":"/synthetic-image-generation"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-